<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric Neurology and Neurodevelopment</h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric Neurology Department, we are dedicated to the diagnosis, treatment and long-term management of disorders affecting the brain, spinal cord, nerves and muscles in children—from newborns to adolescents. With a compassionate team and cutting-edge neuroscientific technology, we provide personalised treatment plans designed to ensure every child receives the expert care they deserve.</p>
<p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services include:</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-5">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Electroencephalogram (EEG)</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Routine and Sleep-Deprived EEG: </strong>Records the brain's electrical activity to detect abnormal patterns associated with epilepsy, seizures and other neurological conditions.</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Video-EEG Monitoring: </strong>Continuous, long-term monitoring to capture and analyse seizure events for precise diagnosis and localisation.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Nerve Conduction Studies (NCS) and Electromyography (EMG)</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Evaluates the function of peripheral nerves and muscles to diagnose neuromuscular disorders such as peripheral neuropathy, muscular dystrophy and myasthenia gravis.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neuroimaging</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Dedicated Paediatric Brain CT and MRI: </strong>High-resolution scans tailored for children to assess brain structure, identify tumours, congenital malformations, stroke or signs of infection.</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Magnetic Resonance Spectroscopy (MRS): </strong>Advanced imaging to analyse the chemical composition of brain tissue, aiding in the diagnosis of metabolic disorders.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Genetic and Metabolic Testing</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive blood and CSF (Cerebrospinal Fluid) analysis to identify underlying genetic syndromes and inborn errors of metabolism that affect neurological function.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Intrathecal Baclofen Pump Management</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Surgical placement and management of a device that delivers muscle relaxant medication (Baclofen) directly into the spinal fluid to control severe spasticity in conditions like Cerebral Palsy.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Vagal Nerve Stimulation (VNS)</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Implantation and programming of a device that sends electrical pulses to the brain via the vagus nerve, used as an adjunctive therapy for drug-resistant epilepsy.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Deep Brain Stimulation (DBS) Assessment</h5>
</div>
<p>Evaluation for this surgical treatment, which involves implanting electrodes in specific brain areas to manage certain movement disorders in older children and teens.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neuro-Rehabilitation Planning</h5>
</div>
<p>Creation of integrated plans incorporating physiotherapy, occupational therapy and speech and language therapy following stroke, brain injury or for long-term conditions like Cerebral Palsy.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Epilepsy and Seizure Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>We manage all types of epilepsy, from common forms to rare and complex syndromes. Our approach includes:</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Antiepileptic Drug (AED) Optimisation: </strong>Individualised drug regimens to achieve seizure freedom with minimal side effects.</p>
<p><strong>Dietary Therapies: </strong>Management of the Ketogenic Diet, Modified Atkins Diet and Low Glycaemic Index Treatment for refractory epilepsy.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricNeurology.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neurodevelopmental Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive care for conditions affecting a child's development, including:</p>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p><strong>Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD): </strong>Integrated management focusing on co-occurring neurological issues, such as anxiety or seizures.</p>
<p><strong>Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD): </strong>Medical and behavioural interventions.</p>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Learning Disabilities and Global Developmental Delay.</p>
</div>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Movement Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Diagnosis and treatment of conditions causing involuntary movements, such as Dystonia, Tremors and Tics/Tourette Syndrome.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Headache and Migraine Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Specialised diagnosis and management of chronic or debilitating headaches and migraines in children and adolescents, including acute treatment and long-term prophylactic strategies.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neuromuscular Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Care for progressive muscle weakness and loss of function, including Spinal Muscular Atrophy (SMA), Muscular Dystrophies and Myasthenia Gravis. Treatment may involve novel gene therapies and supportive care.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neuro-Oncology and Neurofibromatosis</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>In collaboration with oncology, we manage the neurological complications of brain and spinal cord tumours and provide specialised surveillance for Neurofibromatosis and other neurocutaneous syndromes.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Cerebral Palsy and Spasticity Management</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>A multidisciplinary programme for managing the motor and associated neurological impairments of Cerebral Palsy, including medication, Botox injections for focal spasticity and rehabilitation planning.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Autoimmune and Inflammatory CNS Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Diagnosis and treatment of conditions where the immune system attacks the central nervous system, such as Multiple Sclerosis and Acute Disseminated Encephalomyelitis (ADEM).</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Stroke and Vascular Neurology</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Rapid diagnosis and management of paediatric stroke, focusing on acute intervention and long-term recovery and prevention.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Sleep Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Assessment and management of neurologically-related sleep issues, including narcolepsy, restless legs syndrome and complex parasomnias.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
